.TH mkoctfile 1 "November 2026" "GNU Octave"
.SH NAME
mkoctfile \- Compile dynamic\-load modules for GNU Octave
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmkoctfile\fP [\fIoption\fP]\|.\|.\|.\& FILE\|.\|.\|.\&
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmkoctfile\fP is used to compile C, C++, or Fortran source code in to a
dynamically loadable \fB.oct\fP file for
.MR octave 1 .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
Print help message.
.TP
.B \-I\fIdir\fP
Add directory \fIdir\fP to compiler search path.
.TP
.B \-D\fIdef[=val]\fP
Define \fIdef\fP in compile command.
.TP
.B \-U\fIdef\fP
Cancel any previous definition of \fIdef\fP.
.TP
.B \-L\fIdir\fP
Add directory \fIdir\fP to linker search path.
.TP
.B \-l\fIlib\fP
Add library \fIlib\fP to link command.
.TP
.B \-pthread
Use POSIX threads.
.TP
.B \-R\fIdir\fP
Add \fB\-R\fP\fIdir\fP to link command.
.TP
.B \-Wl,\fIoption\fP
Pass \fIoption\fP to the linker such as \fB\-Wl,\-rpath=...\fP
.TP
.B \-W\fIwarn\fP
Pass \fIwarn\fP option to the compiler.
.TP
.B \-c\fR,\fB \-\-compile
Compile, but do not link.
.TP
.B \-M\fR,\fB \-\-depend
Generate dependency files (\fB.d\fP) for C and C++ source files.
.TP
.B \-g
Enable debugging options for compilers.
.TP
.B \-o \fIfile\fP\fR,\fB \-\-output \fIfile\fP
Output filename.
.br
Default extension is \fB.oct\fP (or \fB.mex\fP if
\fB\-\-mex\fP is specified) unless linking a stand-alone executable.
.TP
.B \-p \fIVAR\fP\fR,\fB \-\-print \fIVAR\fP
Print configuration variable \fIVAR\fP.
.br
There are three categories of variables:
.IP
Octave configuration variables that users may override with environment
variables.  These are used in commands that \%\fBmkoctfile\fP executes.

.RS
.Vb
    ALL_CFLAGS                  FPICFLAG
    ALL_CXXFLAGS                INCFLAGS
    ALL_FFLAGS                  INCLUDEDIR
    ALL_LDFLAGS                 LDFLAGS
    CC                          LD_STATIC_FLAG
    CFLAGS                      LIBDIR
    CPICFLAG                    OCTAVE_LINK_OPTS
    CPPFLAGS                    OCTINCLUDEDIR
    CXX                         OCTAVE_LIBS
    CXXFLAGS                    OCTAVE_LINK_DEPS
    CXXLD                       OCTLIBDIR
    CXXPICFLAG                  OCT_LINK_DEPS
    DEPEND_FLAGS                OCT_LINK_OPTS
    DL_LDFLAGS                  RDYNAMIC_FLAG
    F77                         SPECIAL_MATH_LIB
    F77_INTEGER8_FLAG           XTRA_CFLAGS
    FFLAGS                      XTRA_CXXFLAGS
.Ve
.RE
.IP
Octave configuration variables as above, but currently unused by
\%\fBmkoctfile\fP.

.RS
    AR                          FFTW_LIBS    
    BLAS_LIBS                   FLIBS        
    FFTW3F_LDFLAGS              LAPACK_LIBS  
    FFTW3F_LIBS                 LIBS         
    FFTW3_LDFLAGS               RANLIB       
    FFTW3_LIBS                  READLINE_LIBS
.Ve
.RE
.IP
Octave configuration variables that are provided for informational purposes
only.  Except for \%\fIOCTAVE_HOME\fP and \%\fIOCTAVE_EXEC_HOME\fP, users may
not override these variables.
.IP
If \%\fIOCTAVE_HOME\fP or \%\fIOCTAVE_EXEC_HOME\fP are set in the environment,
then other variables are adjusted accordingly with \%\fIOCTAVE_HOME\fP or
\%\fIOCTAVE_EXEC_HOME\fP substituted for the original value of the directory
specified by the \%\-\-\fIprefix\fP or \%\-\-\fIexec\-prefix\fP options that
were used when Octave was configured.

.RS
    API_VERSION                 LOCALAPIOCTFILEDIR
    ARCHLIBDIR                  LOCALAPIPKGDIR
    BINDIR                      LOCALARCHLIBDIR
    CANONICAL_HOST_TYPE         LOCALFCNFILEDIR
    DATADIR                     LOCALOCTFILEDIR
    DATAROOTDIR                 LOCALSTARTUPFILEDIR
    DEFAULT_PAGER               LOCALVERARCHLIBDIR
    EXEC_PREFIX                 LOCALVERFCNFILEDIR
    EXEEXT                      LOCALVEROCTFILEDIR
    FCNFILEDIR                  MAN1DIR
    IMAGEDIR                    MAN1EXT
    INFODIR                     MANDIR
    INFOFILE                    OCTAVE_EXEC_HOME
    LIBEXECDIR                  OCTAVE_HOME
    LIBOCTAVE                   OCTAVE_VERSION
    LIBOCTINTERP                OCTDATADIR
    LIBOCTMEX                   OCTDOCDIR
    LOCALAPIARCHLIBDIR          OCTFILEDIR
    LOCALAPIFCNFILEDIR          OCTFONTSDIR
                                STARTUPFILEDIR
.Ve
.RE
.TP
.B \-\-link\-stand\-alone
Link a stand-alone executable file.
.TP
.B \-\-mex
Create a MEX file.
Set the default output extension to "\fB.mex\fP".  Link to
\%\fBliboctmex\fP instead of \%\fBliboctinterp\fP and \%\fBliboctave\fP.
.TP
.B \-s\fR,\fB \-\-strip
Strip output file.
.TP
.B \-n\fR,\fB \-\-dry-run\fR,\fB \-\-just-print\fR
Print commands, but do not execute them.
.TP
.B \-v\fR,\fB \-\-verbose
Echo commands as they are executed.
.TP
.B FILE
Compile or link FILE.
.br
Recognized file types are:

.RS
.Vb
   .c    C source
   .cc   C++ source
   .cp   C++ source
   .cpp  C++ source
   .CPP  C++ source
   .cxx  C++ source
   .c++  C++ source
   .C    C++ source
   .f    Fortran source (fixed form)
   .F    Fortran source (fixed form)
   .f90  Fortran source (free form)
   .F90  Fortran source (free form)
   .o    object file
   .a    library file
.Ve
.RE
.SH AUTHOR
John W. Eaton and many others.  The list of contributors to the Octave project
may be shown from within \%\fBoctave\fP by executing
"\fB\%doc \%Acknowledgements\fP".  The list is also available online at
.UR https://\:\%docs.octave.org/\:\%latest/\:\%Acknowledgements\:\%.html
.UE .
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.MR octave 1 .
